      "message": "feat(cdk-axum): support redis-cluster for caching\n\n- Add redis cluster client configuration with async initialization\n- Refactor redis configuration into environment parser\n- Use ConnectionManager for automatic reconnection\n- Replace sync From trait with async from_config to prevent nested block_on panics\n- Update Cargo.lock.msrv for new redis dependencies\n- Add docker-compose.redis-cluster.yaml for local testing",
