      "message": "refactor(wallet): replace locked proof passthrough bool with send mode\n\nReplace the send-side `allow_locked_proofs` boolean with an explicit\n`P2PKLockedProofSendMode` enum. The default remains swapping P2PK-locked\nproofs, while direct signed passthrough is now represented as `SignAndSend`.\n\nUpdate the wallet re-export, FFI conversions/defaults, and P2PK integration\ntests to use the new mode.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "963b60d2bb1c9732608408cf69afe3981c8d81d6",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cashubtc/cdk/git/trees/963b60d2bb1c9732608408cf69afe3981c8d81d6"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cashubtc/cdk/git/commits/25c274c5979d2762f4dda48560c1612c78fd2941",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQT7FBefWxISmS43iYljrW0Ju/53gwUCag8hRQAKCRBjrW0Ju/53\ng7/sAP9b/dTrRA9h0XBoepkdQUAr+SKawgFoQHPExOFxM6OgtwD/S67xCjZZn65K\nFc9q/cYYreIHwriNxwm9V0R9olDUOwU=\n=yXex\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree 963b60d2bb1c9732608408cf69afe3981c8d81d6\nparent aa7d4cf783b7e20e07e479dfbbd08ff6c4a9b420\nauthor thesimplekid <tsk@thesimplekid.com> 1779218383 +0200\ncommitter thesimplekid <tsk@thesimplekid.com> 1779376453 +0200\nchange-id knsnswonllopsmvxyzxosxspsplotvtl\n\nrefactor(wallet): replace locked proof passthrough bool with send mode\n\nReplace the send-side `allow_locked_proofs` boolean with an explicit\n`P2PKLockedProofSendMode` enum. The default remains swapping P2PK-locked\nproofs, while direct signed passthrough is now represented as `SignAndSend`.\n\nUpdate the wallet re-export, FFI conversions/defaults, and P2PK integration\ntests to use the new mode.\n",
        "verified_at": "2026-05-21T15:14:21Z"
      }
    },
